Text Notes 1000 9000 0    60   ~ 0
Keypad R1-R4 -> IO32 IO33 IO25 IO26, C1-C4 -> IO27 IO14 IO13 IO4.  Joystick X/Y/SW -> IO34/IO35/IO39.
Text Notes 1000 9150 0    60   ~ 0
LCD SDA/SCL -> IO21/IO22 through Q1/Q2 BSS138 level shifter.  LEDs -> IO19 (green), IO18 (red).  VBAT/2 -> IO36.
Text Notes 1000 9300 0    60   ~ 0
J6 DS-428 is the ON/OFF switch (TP4056 OUT+ -> VSW).  The battery still charges when it is OFF.
Text Notes 1000 9450 0    60   ~ 0
2x18650 in PARALLEL only.  Set MT3608 to 5.0 V before connecting the ESP32.
$EndSCHEMATC
